    "detailed_description": "When you arrive on a floor in a prime building in Tokyo, you're trapped in an endless array of corridors until you reach your office.<br>To get out of this endless loop, you have to keep an eye on the changes that appear in the hallway.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GameSystem</h2>Don't miss the changes that appear in the hallway leading to the office, turn back if there is an anomaly, or continue on if there is not.<br>If you answer correctly 7 times in a row, you will be cleared.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >anomalie</h2>There are about 30 anomalies. Find them all and aim for complete clearance. \uff08The ending doesn't change\uff09<br>Sometimes you may come across unreal situations and paranormal phenomena...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >anomalie list</h2>You can see the anomalies in a list.<br>In addition, once an anomaly has appeared, it will no longer appear, so you can see which anomalies can appear while playing.<br>If it finds all the anomalies, it will display a message.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >broadcast</h2>Regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation, it can be distributed without permission.",
